spice
* Op-Amp Circuit SPICE Netlist

* Nodes and Connections
Vin 1 0 DC 0          * Input voltage source
Vcc 5 0 DC 15         * Power supply

* Components
R1 5 2 10k            * Resistor R1
R2 2 0 1k             * Resistor R2
Cby 2 0 10uF          * Capacitor CBY

* Op-Amp
XOP 1 2 3 5 0 OPAMP   * Op-Amp model, custom defined as OPAMP

* Output
Vout 3 0              * Output 

.END